    "explanation": "To both parties. The S$4.50 no-show cancellation fee stands and the driver is paid S$3.60, and a false-arrival note is recorded against the driver.\n\nWhat happened. Driver DRV-09749 tapped 'I'm Here' at 09:39:14 (EV-TRIP-02749). The GPS export (EV-GPS-02749) does not place him inside the 50 m STANDARD pickup geofence then - the first qualifying in-geofence fix is at 09:41:14, 120 seconds later (derived dwell_start_offset_sec -120) - and the driver says so himself: 'I pressed arrived a bit early but I did wait at the pin.' The arrival marker was therefore pressed early and, under POL-NS-05, does not start the waiting clock; the clock is recomputed from the first qualifying in-geofence fix at 09:41:14. The rider is right that the app showed an arrival that had not yet happened.\n\nWhy the fee still stands. On the recomputed clock the driver held position inside the geofence from 09:41:14 to 09:44:44 - a continuous dwell of 210 seconds against the 180-second free waiting period in force (trip record platform_policy.free_wait_sec = 180; the derived shortfall is -30 s, i.e. a 30-second surplus). POL-NS-05(iii) therefore applies: the corrected dwell meets the minimum, so the early marker does not by itself defeat the fee and POL-NS-01 governs. All four limbs hold - (a) the arrived event exists; (b) read from the recomputed clock, the trace puts the driver in the geofence at 09:41:14; (c) the 210 s in-geofence dwell exceeds 180 s; and (d) there is no boarding event and the trip was terminated by the driver at 09:44:46, reason code RIDER_NO_SHOW, after the dwell elapsed. POL-NS-02's proximity test is met by 22 qualifying in-geofence fixes. POL-NS-03 does not apply (the driver's stationary fixes are inside the radius, not outside it); the effective dwell is not short, so POL-NS-06 gives no refund; and POL-NS-10 governs a rider's cancellation, which this was not. The rider's request for the S$4.50 is therefore refused: EV-FARE-02749 shows payment_status CHARGED with refund_issued_sgd 0.00, and that state stands.\n\nThe rider's arguments. The rider's claim that limb (b) of POL-NS-01 fails is rejected: that limb has a second branch for exactly this situation - where POL-NS-05 finds the marker false, the limb is read from the first qualifying in-geofence fix - so an early marker does not make the fee unchargeable where the corrected dwell carries it. The rider's point that the free-wait timer started on an arrival that had not happened is accepted as to the clock (it runs from 09:41:14, not 09:39:16), but the recomputed dwell still meets the minimum, so the fee stands. The rider's request to send the case to human review on an unresolved arrival conflict is refused: POL-NS-05 is the clause that resolves a marker-versus-trace conflict, the trip record, trace and chat agree on the material facts here, and no POL-NS-09 trigger fires. The driver's arguments are accepted throughout, including that the false marker is recorded as a referral rather than voiding the fee (POL-NS-05(iii)) and that the anti-farming check does not trip (no_show_terminations_30d = 1, below 4; 1/75 = 0.013, below 0.08), so compensation is paid rather than withheld.\n\nThe driver's payment. POL-NS-07 fixes the payout at 80% of the S$4.50 net cancellation fee = S$3.60, the figure EV-FARE-02749 itself computes as driver_compensation. That S$3.60 is a separate platform-funded payment; it is not netted against the rider's S$4.50 charge, which is unchanged.\n\nEvidence and confidence. No artifact is impaired under POL-NS-08: EV-GPS-02749 is COMPLETE at weight 1.0 (100% coverage, 10-second cadence, no gaps, max_gap 0.0), the 09:39:14 arrived event falls on the trace's cadence grid so there is no clock skew, the chat log matches the recorded message count, and EV-FARE-02749's S$4.50 line reconciles with platform_policy.cancellation_fee_sgd. The only sub-1.0 artifact, EV-ADVIS-02749-01 (MISSING_ARTIFACT, weight 0.0), carries no deciding fact for either side. Confidence 0.9, above the 0.70 escalation floor. The monetary effect (S$3.60) is below the S$8.00 POL-GEN-05 threshold, so it executes automatically."
